## Nx Workspace

This is an [Nx monorepo](https://nx.dev) workspace containing multiple apps and shared libraries.

### Apps

- **website** - Public-facing Next.js website (landing page, marketing)
- **dashboard** - React dashboard app (user portal, authenticated features)
- **api** - NestJS backend API (REST endpoints, database, auth)
- **blog** - Next.js blog with MDX support
- **docs** - Documentation site with Nextra

### Libraries

- **@<%= projectName %>/ui** - Shared UI components (shadcn/ui, Tailwind)
- **@<%= projectName %>/auth** - Authentication logic, hooks, and context
- **@<%= projectName %>/billing** - Stripe integration and billing components
- **@<%= projectName %>/shared** - Shared utilities, types, and constants

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start all apps in development mode
npm run dev

# Or start individual apps
npm run website:dev    # Start website on http://localhost:3000
npm run dashboard:dev  # Start dashboard on http://localhost:4200
npm run api:dev        # Start API on http://localhost:3333

# Run database migrations (first time setup)
npm run db:migrate

# Run tests
npm test

# Lint code
npm run lint

# Build for production
npm run build
```

